{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1763980,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Feed Forward Case Challenge (UG) - Aahara Parva 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":599,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-10T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/feed-forward-case-challenge-ug-aahara-parva-2026-indian-institute-of-plantation-management-iipm-bangalore-k-1763980","region":"online","details":"<p id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-565\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0\">A real-world-style case from the agri-food value chain (farm to fork)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2\">. Undergraduate teams must analyse the case and give structured, justified, and practical recommendations focused on one specific problem while addressing innovation, sustainability, and resilience<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Guidelines &amp; Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-566\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,0,0,0\">Conducted in 2 rounds: Online Written Submission (Round 1) and Live Online Presentation via Google Meet for top-scoring teams (Round 2)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,0,0\">Round 1 Deliverables (Due 12 October 2026, 11:59 PM IST)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,0,2\">:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-568\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,0,0,0\">Presentation deck: PDF or PPT format, maximum 12 slides (title and reference slides excluded)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-569\" data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,1,0,0\">Write-up document: PDF format, maximum 5 pages of A4 at 11-point font size (cover page and references excluded)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,0,1,1,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-570\" data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Eligibility:<\/strong> Undergraduate (UG) students only. All 3 team members must be UG<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-571\" data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-college Team Members:<\/strong> Not Allowed<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-572\" data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-specialization Team Members:<\/strong> Allowed<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_2cb99921db791e66-573\" data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Problem Statements \/ Case Drop:<\/strong> Agri-food value chain case study released on 9 October 2026, at 10:00 AM IST<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration of Rounds:<\/strong> Written submission period (9&ndash;12 October 2026); Live presentation round (8-minute presentation followed by 4 minutes of Q&amp;A on 16 October 20.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-633\" data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,0,0,0\">Public sources may be used but must be cited in APA 7th edition format; paid\/restricted databases are prohibited<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-634\" data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,1,0,0\">Plagiarism limit: Similarity of 20% or more without proper attribution will be treated as plagiarism<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-635\" data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,2,0,0\">AI tools are allowed only for research, drafting support, and formatting with full disclosure<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0,1,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Cash prizes and merit certificates for winners, e-certificates of participation for all.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":26886847,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T00:58:34+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-02T21:53:28+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"case_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"y43lBOT","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":15,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":10,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-01 01:05:06","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":false,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/6abe011a9db7f_","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d